OL,3,GNEWSA'The veil of shame around
OL,4,Apostnatal depression needs to go'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Women, since the beginning of time,
OL,7,Fhave birthed and looked after children
OL,8,Fand I just couldn't be bothered. I
OL,9,Fthought I was lazy."
OL,11,FThose are the words of Laura, 45, from
OL,12,FCheltenham, in Gloucestershire, who
OL,13,Fweeks after undergoing an emergency
OL,14,FCaesarean section struggled so much
OL,15,Fwith postnatal depression that she
OL,16,Fneeded psychiatric care.
OL,18,FThe NHS says postnatal depression, also
OL,19,Fknown as postpartum depression, is a
OL,20,F"common" mental health condition that
OL,21,Fcan happen after having a baby.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
